@guide H_Nagrand
@name Nagrand (Garadar)
@faction Horde
@levels 64-67
@zone Nagrand
@chapter Outland
@desc Garadar and the Mag'har, the Throne of the Elements, the Nesingwary safari, the Burning Blade and Kil'sorrow, and the Ring of Blood.
@next H_BladesEdge

fp Garadar
bind Garadar
accept Missing Mag'hari Procession | Matron Drakia.
accept The Impotent Leader | Jorin Deadeye.
accept Wanted: Giselda the Crone
