turnin Murkblood Leaders...
turnin The Impotent Leader | Turned in at Terokkar Forest.
accept Don't Kill the Fat One | Escort quest: start it when you are ready to follow.
complete Don't Kill the Fat One | Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
turnin Don't Kill the Fat One | Turned in at Terokkar Forest.
